<title>SPAIN: Norddeutsche LB issues 10-yr 10 bln pta matador.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche LB issues 10-yr 10 bln pta matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norddeutsche Landesbank has issued a 10-year 10 billion pesetas matador bond with a step-up coupon, the lead manager and book keepers Deutsche Bank in Madrid said.</p>
<p>It added the first coupon is 5.4 percent, with the second one at 7.10 percent. Issue price is 101.5.</p>
<p>Issue date is July 28 1997, and maturity July 30 2007.</p>
<p>The issue is callable at the end of the second year.</p>
<p>Total fees are 1.50 percent</p>
<p>Ratings are S&amp;P and Moody's at AA1, IBCA AAA.</p>
</text>
